Day 2.
Grandpa is the same as yesterday.
There was no change worth mentioning.{p}

"Why are you trying to kill me? Answer me."
"To get revenge."
For a moment Kazama smirked, but he quickly remembered his position, put on a pathetic face and said it again.{p}

"...It's for revenge, sir."
"For what?! I don't even know you!
Why would anyone want revenge on me?!"{p}
